{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:723","content":{"id":723,"title":"用最少数量的箭引爆气球","content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有一些球形气球贴在一堵用 XY 平面表示的墙面上。墙面上的气球记录在整数数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"points","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"points[i] = [x_start, x_end]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示水平直径在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x_start","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x_end","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"之间的气球。你不知道气球的确切 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"y","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 坐标。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一支弓箭可以沿着 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 轴从不同点 完全垂直 地射出。在坐标 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处射出一支箭，若有一个气球的直径的开始和结束坐标为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x_start","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"x_end","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，且满足 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x_start ≤ x ≤ x_end","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则该气球会被引爆。可以射出的弓箭的数量没有限制。弓箭一旦被射出之后，可以无限地前进。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"points","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，返回引爆所有气球所必须射出的最小弓箭数。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以气球最右端进行从小到大排序，排序后，对于一个区间，后续的区间如果与该区间有交集，即这些区间的起始位置小于该区间的结束位置，那么这些区间就可以一箭解决，否则就需要新开一箭。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"function findMinArrowShots(points: number[][]): number {\n    points.sort((a, b) => a[1] - b[1]);\n    let preEnd = points[0][1];\n    let res = 1;\n    for (let i = 1; i < points.length; i++) {\n        if (points[i][0] > preEnd) {\n            preEnd = points[i][1];\n            res++;\n        }\n    }\n\n    return res;\n};","language":"ts","uuid":"f4a3b9bd-cc3a-4934-a89e-596c22341578","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}],"level":2},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode.cn/problems/minimum-number-of-arrows-to-burst-balloons/?envType=study-plan-v2&envId=top-interview-150","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用最少数量的箭引爆气球"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"贪心"},{"label":"用最少数量的箭引爆气球","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:723","type":"doc","id":723}}],"prevPage":{"title":"加油站","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:721","type":"doc","id":721}},"nextPage":{"title":"x 的平方根","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:715","type":"doc","id":715}},"createTime":1730039141313,"updateTime":1744296863904,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296863904}}